        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Voyager is a hydraulic, self-propelled drilling unit on rubber tracks for horizontal, vertical and inclined holes. It is powered by a hydraulic power pack with a 17 kW diesel or petrol engine or a 15 kW electric motor.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With the hydraulic rotary head and a pneumatic down-the-hole (DTH) hammer it drills large holes for the diamond wire. With the rotary head and diamond crowns it core drills more than 30 metres with diameters of 64 - 90 mm, and with hydro-pneumatic rock drills it makes holes of various diameters.",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Voyager is the same machine as the <a href=\"/produkter/marini/crawlers/mr-c-10\">MR-C 10</a> in Marini's crawler rig line.",
          "gen": true
        },
